 669:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * Match the procedure given in RFC 6979 §3.3 (deterministic ECDSA)
 670:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * when f_rng is a suitably parametrized instance of HMAC_DRBG:
 671:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * - use the same byte ordering;
 672:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * - keep the leftmost n_bits bits of the generated octet string;
 673:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * - try until result is in the desired range.
 674:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum_core.c ****      * This also avoids any bias, which is especially important for ECDSA.
